s.\r\n I require equal parts Flour, Lotus Seed and Egg Yolk to make a single Moon Cake.\r\n'),(3123,'´Ù¸¥ Àç·á´Â ÀúÇÑÅ× ´Ù ÀÖÀ¸´Ï ¿©·¯ºÐÀº ½Ò°¡·ç, ²Ü, ¼ÖÀÙÀ» °¡Á®¿Í ÁÖ¼¼¿ä.','¨ä¥L§÷®Æ§Ú¤w¸g·Ç³Æ¦n¤F¡A¦U¦ì§âÄz¦Ì¯»¡B»e¿}©MªQ°w¥æµ¹§Ú§a¡C','','','','¨ä¥L§÷®Æ§Ú¤w¸g·Ç³Æ¦n¤F¡A¦U¦ì§âÄz¦Ì¯»¡B»e¿}©MªQ°w¥æµ¹§Ú§a¡C\r\n','y‚¨’cŽqz‚ÌÞ—¿‚Í@ƒXƒXƒL@ŒŽ@ƒEƒTƒM@‚È‚ñ‚Å‚·B','¤èªk«ÜÂ²³æ,¥u¶·­n¬¼Ây©Çª«´N¥i±o¨ì¡uÄÑ¯»¡v,¡uÀ`®Æ¡v,¡u³J¶À¡v,','However, please do understand that the Moon Cakes dont always come out properly, there is a 30% chance that the Moon Cakes are spoilt along with the ingredients. There is a special Moon Cake that is especially delicious, the Elders of the Council of Towns','Even with all of my experience, Moon Cakes are very difficult to make and there is a 30% chance the Moon Cake will be ruined. If the cake is ruined, the ingredients will be lost\r\n\r\nIf you collect enough Moon Cakes, I can attempt to make a Full Moon Cake.','3123','¨ä¥L§÷®Æ§Ú¤w¸g·Ç³Æ¦n¤F¡A¦U¦ì§âÄz¦Ì¯»¡B»e¿}©MªQ°w¥æµ¹§Ú§a¡C','However, please do understand that the Moon Cakes dont always come out properly, there is a 30% chance that the Moon Cakes are spoilt along with the ingredients. There is a special Moon Cake that is especially delicious, the Elders of the Council of Towns','Es gibt eine 30% Chance, dass die Plätzchen beim Herstellen zerstört werden. Wenn du zehn Plätzchen hast, kannst du sie in einen Korb zusammen packen, den Du bei Landy gegen andere tolle Dinge eintauschen kannst.','Hay un 30% de posibilidades de que la elaboración de galletas fracase. Si tienes 10 galletas se pueden ponerlas todas juntas en una cesta. Landy te las puede cambiar por algún objeto.','Il existe une chance de 30% que les petits gâteaux se brisent lors de la production. Une fois que tu as 10 petits gâteaux, tu peux les mettre ensemble dans une corbeille que tu pourras échanger contre des choses fantastiques.','3123','Ïîìíè: ïå÷ü ëóííûå ïèðîæíûå íå òàê-òî ëåãêî. Òðèäöàòü øàíñîâ èç ñòà, ÷òî âûéäåò áðàê, è èíãðå