'','','',''),(5867,'','','','','','','','','','Affinity Monster Information','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5868,'','','','','','','','','','Fortune Costume','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5869,'','','','','','','','','','Would you like to check your destiny within your costume? I must tell you, destiny once decided cannot be turned back.î','2   Don\'t worry about the next thing, do as you want.','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5870,'','','','','','','','','','Believe in yourself and act follow your gut feeling with courage.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5871,'','','','','','','','','','Open your ears to others and search your inner spirit to find solution to your problem. Your subconscious intuition can be a help.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5872,'','','','','','','','','','Do not focus your sight to one place and look through the others to prepare for unexpected problems.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5873,'','','','','','','','','','You shall be standing with high spirits with everything from the world, but you must not hide your thoughts and emotions too much.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5874,'','','','','','','','','','If there\'s a conflict of opinions, listen to the 3rd person\'s thoughts. But you must make decision on your own.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5875,'','','','','','','','','','Open your heart to others for collaboration and search for the meaning of enjoyment.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5876,'','','','','','','','','','With the firm sense of purpose, you shall challenge on positive lines but also must wait for the good timing.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5877,'','','','','','','','','','Do not throw a tantrum but act according to your conviction. Reminder the pitfall of excessive pride.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5878,'','','','','','','','','','Suitable silence and objectivity is great but too much of it can leave you out of place..','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5879,'','','','','','','','','','Do not fear adventure and change, do not hesitate when there\'s a opportunity upon yourself.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5880,'','','','','','','','','','Pay attention to all decisions, try to look through the eyes of justice. Do not act impulsively.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5881,'','','','','','','','','','There\'s a need to check if you are sacrificing yourself too much and giving away to others.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5882,'','','','','','','','','','It is the time for change in actions or thoughts. When a door closes, another one will open. Don\'t be stubborn.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5883,'','','','','','','','','','To move on, you shall need to invest in time to take a cautious attitude and neutral attitude.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5884,'','','','','','','','','','There\'s a need to check if you are holding onto something too much to become lethargic when you are actually full with strength to get out of the current situation.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5886,'','','','','','','','','','You must take time to look after yourself when there\'s unexpected change inside or outiside.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5887,'','','','','','','','','','believe in yourself and act follow your gut feeling with courage.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5888,'','','','','','','','','','Even with the fear of the change and being blinded with distrust, you must look around well with care.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5889,'','','','','','','','','','Keep up the spirit open minded, you will accomplish what you have desired and feel pleasure of everything.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5890,'','','','','','','','','','It is up to you on how to handle the situation that you have just run into. You could go through inner change depending on how you endure he circumstances.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5891,'','','','','','','','','','You shall reach rational conclusion, but must not forget of the things you went through to stand where you are right now ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5892,'','','','','','','','','','Nondisclosure','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5893,'','','','','','','','','','Fortune Information.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5894,'','','','','','','','','','Advice: %s','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5895,'','','','','','','','','','\"It is a difficult job to remove jewel from sockets and to remove just one jewel, you need a special magic scroll.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5896,'','','','','','','','','','Total Removal of Jewels','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5897,'','','','','','','','','','Individual Removal of Jewels','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5898,'','','','','','','','','','Place the gear and choose the jewel from the socket you wish to remove.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5899,'','','','','','','','','','Place the magic scroll required to remove the jewel.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5900,'','','','','','','','','','Proceed Removal','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5901,'','','','','','','','','','Chaos Socket','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5902,'','','','','','','','','','You cannot trade more gold than the amount you actually have.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5903,'','','','','','','','','','How much gold would you like to trade?','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5904,'','','','','','','','','','How much gold would you like to deposit?','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5905,'','','','','','','