s been removed.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5923,'','','','','','','','','',' ','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5924,'','','','','','','','','','This jewel is not suitable for fusion.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5925,'','','','','','','','','','Jewel Fusion','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5926,'','','','','','','','','','Through fusion of 3 jewels, I can create a new jewel for you. By a very low chance you can acquire a Chaos Jewel. If you bring me a Jewel Fusion Scroll, you can simply increase chance to get a good quality jewel.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5927,'','','','','','','','','','General Jewel Fusion','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5928,'','','','','','','','','','Chaos Jewel Fusion','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5929,'','','','','','','','','','Load Chaos Jewel','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5930,'','','','','','','','','','%s - How many would you like to load? (Max 99) They will be consumed after use.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5931,'','','','','','','','','','Load General Jewel','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5932,'','','','','','','','','','Jewel Fusion available.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5933,'','','','','','','','','','Fusion','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5934,'','','','','','','','','','There\'s no jewel for fusion.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5935,'','','','','','','','','','Not enough jewels.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5936,'','','','','','','','','','Wrong item loaded, you need Jewel Fusion Scroll','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5937,'','','','','','','','','','Load Jewel Fusion Scroll to help fusion.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5938,'','','','','','','','','','Jewel created through fusion.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',''),(5939,'','','','','